commit 112ce50d6834bf1ebc92596314aa6d3663404e5f
Author: Rasmus Enevoldsen <rasmus@enev.dk>
Date:   Thu Jul 23 18:57:28 2026 +0200

    Add --extra-models-dir flag for extra downloadable models
    
    The g2pW model (used for Chinese phonemization) is looked up in the
    current working directory, and downloaded there if missing.
    
    This commit adds a --extra-models-dir flag so users can point Piper at a
    prefetched model instead, e.g. for offline or sandboxed environments.
    
    The flag is generic and intended to cover any future downloadable
    models, not just g2pW.
    
    It is not called --download-dir because that name is taken by a flag
    in the http server cli.

